{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 59,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER059.YBC",
      "sha256": "75d8aa039016740bb028feba882422f73c41f2688a5cc483e100e432fdd83d04",
      "text_count": 106,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 114,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "你，好像很喜歡自己一個人獨處嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 164,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "夏朧‧佛洛斯蘋……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 198,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "我也喜歡自己一個人獨處。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 232,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "所以，當我想一個人獨處的時候，\n如果有人來到我身邊的話，\n會讓我感覺有點煩悶。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 258,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 298,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "然而，雖然我通常是這麼想，\n有時候，卻也會希望有人能夠來跟我說話。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 320,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "我真是個自私的人呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 342,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "雖然我不知道你是不是也是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 382,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "……當我來到這白皙城砦的時候，\n我曾這麼想："
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 416,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "只是自私地因為喜歡伊諾森提雅，\n所以才加入這裡的我，\n大家連一句話都沒有責怪過呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 442,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 474,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "如果我是妳的話，就算只說一兩句也好，\n多少總是會責難一下的吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 502,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "不，在那之前，\n說不定根本不會接受像我這樣的人呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 542,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22
          ],
          "text": "……大家都已經是同伴了，\n還說這樣的話，那不就更難開始了嗎。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 564,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾就是純潔之盾。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 592,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "「真的這樣就好了嗎？」\n雖然我一開始也曾經這樣懷疑過。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 618,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 652,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 692,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29
          ],
          "text": "究竟是……\n能夠說出這樣的話的妳，實在了不起呢……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 718,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 758,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32
          ],
          "text": "還是，是讓人說出了這句話的純潔之盾，\n實在了不起呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 780,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "到底是怎樣呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 814,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "我想，那一定不是因為我的關係。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 840,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 866,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 900,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "我啊，拋棄了那曾經照顧我的葛斯貝布洛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 934,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "這樣啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 968,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "也曾經對純潔之盾做了很過分的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1002,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "這我不否認。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1036,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "可是就算是這樣，我卻還是被收容了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1070,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "所以我們才能像現在這樣地交談呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1116,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            43,
            44,
            45
          ],
          "text": "…………\n「變得很憧憬純潔之盾的一切，\n而希望像這樣地在這裡生活下去……」"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1138,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "我很快就發現了我自己有這樣的想法。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1164,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1190,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "就因為我知道這裡對我來說很重要……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1218,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            49,
            50
          ],
          "text": "所以我不想再因為我的任性，\n而給大家添麻煩。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1252,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            51
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1286,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            52
          ],
          "text": "沒錯，就是這樣……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1308,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "我從來沒有想過竟然會有這樣的感覺。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1330,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "我也絕對不想失去這樣的感覺。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1356,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1382,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1422,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            57,
            58
          ],
          "text": "……我也是。\n剛來這裡的時候，我也是這麼想。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1444,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "而凱洛特幫助我想通了這件事。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1472,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            60,
            61
          ],
          "text": "老老師也是、帕彌菈學姊也是、法娜學姊也是\n，大家都幫了我不少的忙。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1506,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "妳……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1540,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "「希望能夠帶給大家笑容。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1568,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            64,
            65
          ],
          "text": "就算會惹人生氣，\n或是讓人流淚的事情也沒關係。」"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1590,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "凱洛特曾經這樣對我說。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1616,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1656,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            68,
            69
          ],
          "text": "而她也曾經說過，為了要完成這個心願，\n就得要好好地照著自己的願望去做。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1684,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            70,
            71
          ],
          "text": "她說，只要做到能夠讓思念不受拘束地，\n從心底被實現的程度就好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1710,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            72
          ],
          "text": "那個時候的我，並不是很瞭解……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1732,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            73
          ],
          "text": "不過，現在其實也不太瞭解就是了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1758,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1792,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "只要像自己想的一樣去做就好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1820,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            76,
            77
          ],
          "text": "而且，大家也都希望能多多瞭解希里鄔司這個\n人呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1846,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            78
          ],
          "text": "同時，大家也都希望能多讓希里鄔司瞭解……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1874,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            79,
            80
          ],
          "text": "希望讓你瞭解到，\n這裡是一個多麼美好的地方。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1908,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "……所以我才不希望這裡遭到破壞呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1942,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "你的存在，真的會讓這裡被破壞嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 1976,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            83
          ],
          "text": "……嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2016,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            84,
            85
          ],
          "text": "如果不試試看的話，又怎麼會知道呢？\n只要照你希望的去做，那就可以了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2050,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2084,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            87
          ],
          "text": "大概，吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2118,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            88,
            89,
            90
          ],
          "text": "如果就照著自己所想的去做看看，\n也許就會發現些什麼從來都沒注意過的事情也\n說不定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2140,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            91
          ],
          "text": "我現在也可以這樣地告訴別人了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2166,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            92
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2192,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            93
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2226,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            94
          ],
          "text": "夏朧‧佛洛斯蘋。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2260,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            95
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2300,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            96,
            97
          ],
          "text": "今天所發生的這些事情，\n我會好好記住的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2334,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            98
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2368,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            99
          ],
          "text": "從今以後，我大概也忘不了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2402,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            100
          ],
          "text": "？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2442,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            101,
            102
          ],
          "text": "在妳的心目中，\n純潔之盾的地位是多麼地重要。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2476,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            103
          ],
          "text": "呵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2498,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            104
          ],
          "text": "我也不會忘記的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 59,
          "source_offset": 2520,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            105
          ],
          "text": "在你心中的這種想法呀。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 60,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER060.YBC",
      "sha256": "46d9a784c4e775da99f3e1db71c5feb2de770263db913f6d19982d1066275ec3",
      "text_count": 52,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 202,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "呼哇～～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 230,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            1,
            2
          ],
          "text": "不管是什麼時候來這裡，\n總是這麼地令人開心呢～！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 282,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "一邊泡著溫泉，一邊又可以欣賞美景，\n這真是奢侈的享受呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 328,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            5,
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "唉呀唉呀，\n雖然把大家都放在一邊然後自己跑來這裡，\n是感覺有點不好意思……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 350,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "但這實在令人太開心啦！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 384,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "呵，這一點我沒有異議。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 418,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "喔耶～～～喔，耶～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 452,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "同樣地。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 474,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "這真是一個好溫泉呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 508,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "艾～爾～雪～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 542,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "……嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 576,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "好像什～麼疲勞都可以消除了呢～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 610,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，是啊，真的是這樣呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 644,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "妳怎麼好像都沒啥感動的樣子咧～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 678,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "才沒有那樣咧……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 700,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "是妳表現得太誇張了啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 722,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "真是讓人受不了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 756,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "除了妳以外，可是沒有人可以看到的唷～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 790,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "可是我剛剛是說，我看到之後會覺得很困擾。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 824,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "……妳想看嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 858,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "別、別開玩笑了！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 892,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "呼～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 914,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "我‧可‧是‧很‧想‧看‧唷☆"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 948,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "住手，不要用那種眼神看著我。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 982,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "嗚啊啊～～我是開玩笑的啊！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1004,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "把劍收起來啦，拜託拜託啦？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1038,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "……不准再有下次囉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1072,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "唉唷～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1094,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "明明稍微變溫柔一點就會比較好的～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1128,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "啊啊，我這樣就可以了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1162,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "可是呢～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1184,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "這樣不好嗎～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1218,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "……妳是在說什麼？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1252,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "可以和希里鄔司待在一起啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1286,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "這都是託帕彌菈的福啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1320,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "大概吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1342,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "嗯～～～那～妳吃醋了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1376,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "……有一點，吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1404,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            42,
            43
          ],
          "text": "雖然他身為謬斯家的嫡子，\n我也希望他變得成熟一點……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1432,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            44,
            45
          ],
          "text": "但是從今以後，就不再需要我去保護他了，\n還真有點寂寞呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1466,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "但就是這樣才更是求之不得啊，不是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1500,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "呵，這倒也是。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1522,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "唉呀，看來我泡的太久，頭有點昏了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1544,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "我先起來囉？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1578,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "好啊好啊～妳就先起來吧～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 60,
          "source_offset": 1600,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            51
          ],
          "text": "我可是還要再享受一下唷～"
        }
      ],
